---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseThemeLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseThemeLayout.astro';
import { FROM_YES_TO_WIN } from '../../../data/breakouts/from-yes-to-win';

const { title, lede, framing, entryState, tracks, questions, artifactFields } = FROM_YES_TO_WIN;
---

<BaseThemeLayout
  title={`${title} · Breakouts · FullStack VC`}
  description={lede}
  noindex={true}
  containerClass="px-6 py-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto"
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Agentic VC Dojo · Monthly All-Hands · 2026-05-27</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">{title}</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">{lede}</p>
  </header>

  <section class="block">
    <h2 class="block-title">The frame</h2>
    <p class="entry-state">{entryState}</p>
    <p class="framing">{framing}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2 class="block-title">Three tracks</h2>
    <div class="tracks-grid">
      {tracks.map((track) => (
        <a class="track-card" href={`/breakouts/from-yes-to-win/${track.slug}`}>
          <div class="track-card-eyebrow">{track.shortName}</div>
          <div class="track-card-title">{track.title}</div>
          <div class="track-card-hook">"{track.hook}"</div>
          <div class="track-card-reality">{track.reality}</div>
          <div class="track-card-cta">Open track →</div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2 class="block-title">Five questions, every track</h2>
    <ol class="questions">
      {questions.map((q) => (
        <li class={`question ${q.n === 5 ? 'question--closer' : ''}`}>
          <div class="question-n">Q{q.n}</div>
          <div class="question-body">
            <p class="question-prompt">{q.prompt}</p>
            <p class="question-lens">{q.lens}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2 class="block-title">What each group brings back</h2>
    <p class="artifact-intro">
      Same shape across all three tracks. 90 seconds at the end, fill it out together. Same shape across all groups makes the report-backs land cleanly and lets us publish the artifacts as proposed projects.
    </p>
    <div class="artifact-card">
      {artifactFields.map((field) => (
        <div class="artifact-field">
          <div class="artifact-label">{field.label}</div>
          <div class="artifact-placeholder">{field.placeholder}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block block--script">
    <h2 class="block-title">Host script — the Q5 moment</h2>
    <p class="script-intro">
      Spoken after the report-backs, before closing remarks. The Q5 poll runs here in the room — not in the breakout discussion. It splits the room into a doer cohort and an audience cohort, both legitimate.
    </p>

    <div class="script">
      <p class="script-stage">[After the last group's report-back, audience settled]</p>

      <p>
        Okay — we've heard from each group. You've each sketched a workflow, a tool, a metric, and an ask. Now I'm going to put one question in front of you.
      </p>

      <p>
        The last Wednesday in June is June 24. That's our next monthly all-hands. Between now and then is four weeks. The question is honest, no judgment either way:
      </p>

      <blockquote class="script-quote">
        Are you willing <em>and</em> able to make time to dig into what your group sketched — or do you want to hear back at the next session?
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        Both answers are real answers. "Hear back" is not opting out — it's opting into the audience, which keeps you in the loop and lets you pick a deeper slot when the timing's right.
      </p>

      <p>
        The poll has two options. Pick the honest one.
      </p>

      <p class="script-stage">[Open Poll 4 — Boolean]</p>

      <p class="script-stage">[Results display]</p>

      <p>
        If you picked option one — willing and able — you're our June 24 cohort. We'll put one shared surface in front of you in the next 48 hours, and one named 30-minute check-in roughly two weeks from now. That's it. No standing meetings, no overhead. You show up, you dig in, you bring something to demo or something stuck.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you picked option two — we'll see you on the 24th. The June session will be built around what this cohort has surfaced. You'll see the results, not have to make them.
      </p>

      <p>
        Either way — thank you for being in the room. This is how the dojo gets sharper. See you on June 24.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2 class="block-title">The 4-week coordination spine</h2>
    <p class="spine-intro">
      Between May 27 and June 24 is where dojos die. Bare minimum to keep the doer cohort alive:
    </p>
    <ul class="spine">
      <li>
        <strong>One named check-in.</strong> 30-minute Zoom in week 2 or 3 (June 10 or 17). Low-stakes. Put it on the calendar before the May 27 session ends.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>One async surface.</strong> Pick one — Slack channel, shared doc, or a per-track entry under <code>/working-groups/active</code>. Don't proliferate.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>A convener per track</strong> — not Michael. One of the doers per track owns the check-in. This is also how June 24's spotlight presenters self-select.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseThemeLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .page-lede {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .block {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    max-width: 48rem;
  }
  .block--script {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }
  .block-title {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .entry-state {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .framing {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tracks-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .tracks-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  .track-card {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--fx-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
  }
  .track-card,
  .track-card * {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .track-card-cta {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }
  .track-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .track-card-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .track-card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .track-card-hook {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .track-card-reality {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .track-card-cta {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .questions {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .question {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--fx-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }
  .question--closer {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 6%, var(--fx-card-bg));
  }
  .question-n {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .question-prompt {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .question-lens {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .artifact-intro {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .artifact-card {
    background: var(--fx-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .artifact-field {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
    padding-left: 0.875rem;
  }
  .artifact-label {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .artifact-placeholder {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .script-intro {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .script {
    background: var(--fx-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .script p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .script-stage {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .script-quote {
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 6%, transparent);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .script-quote em {
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .spine-intro {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .spine {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .spine li {
    padding: 0.875rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  .spine li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .spine strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .spine code {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    padding: 0.125rem 0.375rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 8%, transparent);
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
  }
</style>
